'''Cynthia''' (Japanese: '''シロナ''' ''Shirona'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=During this turn, attacks used by your {{TCGP|Garchomp}} or {{TCGP|Togekiss}} do +50 damage to your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

